# IntelliROI Frontend Theme

Keep every UI change inside the IntelliROI design system. Full tokens: `docs/DESIGN_SYSTEM.md`. Workflow skill: `.cursor/skills/intelliroi-theme/SKILL.md`.

## Tokens (required)

- **bg** `ink` `#09090B` · **surface** `#111827` · **hairline** `#2A2A2A`
- **text** `text-primary` `#F8FAFC` · `text-secondary` `#CBD5E1`
- **accent** mint `#00E5A8` only (not purple). Secondary data: `#4F8CFF`
- **fonts** Inter (`font-sans`) prose; JetBrains Mono (`font-mono`) labels/CTAs/metrics/logo
- **radius** sharp (no soft cards). Status dots may be `rounded-full`

## Patterns

- Sections: `SectionShell` + `Chapter` + one headline + short body
- Primary CTA: filled mint → transparent + accent text on hover; optional mint glow
- Secondary CTA: hairline border → accent border/text on hover
- Layouts: hairline `gap-px` mosaics, 4/8 editorial, 2-col splits — not floating soft cards
- Icons: Lucide `strokeWidth={1.5}` only

## Motion

- Reuse `Reveal` / `CountUp` from `shared.jsx`
- Ease `[0.22, 1, 0.36, 1]`; live status → `animate-pulse-dot`
- Lenis owns smooth scroll (`duration: 1.15`)

## Forbidden

```jsx
// ❌ Light backgrounds, purple accents, rounded-2xl card stacks, Inter-only chrome
<div className="rounded-2xl bg-white shadow-xl text-purple-600">…

// ✅
<div className="border border-hairline bg-ink p-6">
  <span className="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent">01</span>
  <h3 className="mt-4 font-medium tracking-tight text-text-primary">…</h3>
</div>
```

No light mode, no cream/terracotta defaults, no hero photography/pill clusters/emoji.
